---
interface Props {
  serviceBanner?: boolean;
}

const { serviceBanner = false } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class:list={['business-perspective-note', serviceBanner && 'business-perspective-note--service']} aria-label="Business and growth perspective">
  <details>
    <summary><strong>Business and growth perspective</strong> <span class="bpn-more">Read the note</span></summary>
    <p>A course, job title or certificate is not automatically scalable. Prefer portable skills, visible proof of work and a route that can eventually serve multiple clients through consulting, a practice, a studio, a product or another business layer. Crowded or rank-gated entry, severe saturation and long ladders where few reach the top do not count as scalability. Keep a second skill route when a choice depends mainly on one employer, one exam or one fixed pay ladder.</p>
  </details>
</aside>

<style>
  .business-perspective-note{max-width:1050px;margin:70px auto 1.25rem;padding:.9rem 1.1rem;border:1px solid rgba(229,184,74,.42);border-left:4px solid #e5b84a;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(229,184,74,.08);color:rgba(255,255,255,.76);line-height:1.6;font-size:.9rem}
  .business-perspective-note summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .business-perspective-note summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .business-perspective-note strong{color:#f5d98c}
  .bpn-more{font-size:.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:underline}
  .business-perspective-note details[open] .bpn-more{display:none}
  .business-perspective-note p{margin-top:.5rem}
  .business-perspective-note--service{margin-top:70px}
</style>
